  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Liquid solution <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br />So, more is <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></msub></math> less is solubility. Solubility of gases is less at higher temperature. So more is the temperature more is the <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></msub></math> as <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mtext>solubility</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>∝</mo></math> temperature",
    "image": null
  },
